# Build context of the main image is agent-console/ (.github/workflows/agent-console.yml).
# The proxy images build from their own sub-folders with their own contexts.
.git
node_modules
dist
coverage
tests
egress
dockerproxy
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
# Root docs are not needed in the image; etc/MANUAL.md is (engines' operating manual).
*.md
!etc/MANUAL.md
